| `GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES` | path list | unset; `tests/conftest.py` appends `tests.scratch_root` for the session | directories joined by `:`, git's own format, an empty entry included | git; `tests/isolation_guard.py` (`point_temp_at`) appends to it and keeps what was there verbatim; `scripts/git_tree.py` stops its walk up for a `.git` entry where it names | Stops git, started in a directory below a listed one, from finding a repository above it, so git started in a scratch project under the test scratch root never finds a repository above the root, such as a home directory kept under version control; `config/project.json` `child_env.names` lists it. | isolating a test's own git configuration: `tests/hermetic_git.py` | always |
